WEBVTT

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:05.606
When fresh produce leaves the warehouse, the work is only half done.

00:00:05.606 --> 00:00:09.147
On consignment, a delivery is not yet a sale.

00:00:09.147 --> 00:00:12.044
EFP Supply Chain keeps those numbers connected.

00:00:13.550 --> 00:00:17.122
The dashboard brings stock levels, upcoming expiry dates,

00:00:17.122 --> 00:00:19.979
and unresolved discrepancies into one view.

00:00:19.979 --> 00:00:24.979
Deliveries by branch and recent movements show where the stock is going.

00:00:26.342 --> 00:00:30.166
Each production batch has its own number and expiry date.

00:00:30.166 --> 00:00:33.354
Remaining quantities stay visible, so staff can check

00:00:33.354 --> 00:00:36.860
which batch is available before recording the next delivery.

00:00:38.217 --> 00:00:41.194
Production adds stock. Deliveries reduce it.

00:00:41.194 --> 00:00:44.543
Warehouse and transit losses are recorded separately.

00:00:44.543 --> 00:00:49.009
Every movement keeps the product, quantity, and responsible user together,

00:00:49.009 --> 00:00:51.614
with delivery references where needed.

00:00:52.967 --> 00:00:56.735
Reconciliation compares the delivery with the branch’s reported sales.

00:00:56.735 --> 00:01:00.845
Fifteen delivered and thirteen sold leaves two units to resolve.

00:01:00.845 --> 00:01:04.613
Accounting can document a write-off or correct an entry,

00:01:04.613 --> 00:01:07.011
keeping the reason on record.

00:01:08.383 --> 00:01:11.731
The consignment summary groups delivered and sold quantities

00:01:11.731 --> 00:01:13.740
by product and branch.

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:18.427
Reports turn that movement history into figures the team can review together.

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:22.907
Warehouse, sales, and accounting have different permissions.

00:01:22.907 --> 00:01:26.013
The audit log records who changed what,

00:01:26.013 --> 00:01:30.156
making stock decisions easier to trace when questions come up.

00:01:31.508 --> 00:01:34.181
From warehouse intake to branch sales,

00:01:34.181 --> 00:01:38.858
EFP Supply Chain gives every stock movement a place in the ledger.

00:01:38.858 --> 00:01:41.197
Built with Django and MySQL.
